					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#708">Yes, we're alive.</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Hey all.  Your friendly neighborhood officer here.  NOt sure how many of you knew I was an officer, but what the heck, right? =)<br />
<br />
So anyway, no real point to this other than to say hello and tell everyone to hang in there.  I know we have yet to go on a raid, but I'll be working with Aeaadien to get something put together for everyone.  We will need more people to be playing at once though.  Often times I find I'm the only one on or maybe a couple others.  A raid can't be done with 5 people. =)  If you know someone or see a person in one of your groups that might like to join, go ahead and ask.  The worst they will do is say no thanks and we've lost nothing on that.  If you have any suggestions on where we might go, let me or aeeadien or any of the other officers know.  Seems a lot off us are in the teens to about 35 or so.  Any suggestions would be helpful in helping us plan it out.<br />
<br />
Also, if you've been playing on an alternate go ahead and send me a tell and I'll get you all set.  I often wonder if people playing on their alts is why our numbers seem small recently.<br />
<br />
At any rate, feel free to talk to me for whatever reason.  I've been on Orchis, my druid, quite a bit of late helping a friend of mine with her mage.  I also play Jagd a bit, so look for both.  I'll post some contact info in my profile as soon as I finish up here.  Again, don't be shy.  Speak up and let yourself be heard! =)
						</td>
					</tr>
